  objThreeImg: {fileID: 0}
  imgHolderOne: {fileID: 1666038030}
  imgHolderTwo: {fileID: 686000820}
  imgHolderThree: {fileID: 169265793}
  hintOpen:
  - Oh, you're having trouble finding my things?
  stringsWand:
  - My magic wand?
  - The last time I was using it was when I came home yesterday
  - I was in such a rush that I didn't even hang my hat up properly
  - Would you mind doing that for me as well?
  stringsBook:
  - Ah, my cursed ring
  - "I won it in a game of Wyrm\u2019s Bluff"
  - I remember locking it away so that no one would steal it
  - I think the combination had to do with shapes,
  - but it's just been so long since I used it...
  stringsRing:
  - The Grimoire?
  - I remember that I hid it away so that the city guards wouldn't find it,
  - but I forgot where.
  - I remember that it was inside of a hidden passage behind something
  - But what could be large enough to hide something like that?
  navCanvas: {fileID: 1687067483}
  puzzleScreen: {fileID: 2118975696}
  dialogLogic: {fileID: 1721575000}
  panelText: {fileID: 320718256}
